<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
